+         everyday concepts behind the vocabulary this site uses. The mapping is \
+         approximate — a bridge into the model, not an exact equivalence.",
+    );
+    push_line(
+        &mut out,
+        "| RDF / OWL / SHACL | Developer concept | Notes |",
